                "icon-color": "#ff0000",
                "icon-scale": 1.5,
                "description": "Tell el-Basta, Tell el-Bassa\n\u062a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0633\u0637\u0629 (\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0635\u0629)\nTell el-Sheikh\n\u062a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u064a\u062e\n\nTell El-Basta is a raised archaeological mound with a few potsherds on its surface, dating to the Greco-Roman Period. The mound includes the remains of a mud-brick building and is surrounded by cultivated land.\nThe site has not yet been excavated.\nInspectorate Officials of South Sinai\n\n\u062a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u064a\u062e \u0645\u0646:\nMap in QGIS:\nEgypt 1100,000, northern Sinai  published by the Survey of Egypt nla.obj-2896313136",
